Camille

I do not know the design details of the survey you are analysing. But I think your suspicions are warranted because the encounter rates shown in the table you provided seem quite large, suggesting, as you note, that effort here is computed only using segments with detections. I note also that none of the regions listed in the table you provided were without detections.

It is good practice to check the program output against what you know about the survey design to ensure the analysis is respecting the design.

